    "No live provider call was run; model acceptance, account availability, and organization entitlements remain unverified.",
    "Hardcoded v5 tuple ladders (ROUTING_LADDERS, OPTIMAL_*_LADDER, BALANCED_GROK_OPENROUTER_*_LADDER, GEMINI_PRIMARY_*_LADDER in run_extraction_v5.py) carry only (provider, model_id, api_key_env) and cannot attach service_tier/reasoning_effort. When phase resolution lands on a tuple-ladder dispatch with step_contract=None, gpt-5.5 calls omit service_tier=flex and grok-4.3 calls omit reasoning_effort=low. Mitigation: model_map/phase contract paths cover all step_id-bound phases; the legacy ladders only fire on no-contract fallback.",
